==English==

===Etymology===
*From Latin ''[[detractum]]'', past participle of ''[[detrahere]]''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}
#To take away; to [[withdraw]] or [[remove]].
#To take [[credit]] or [[reputation]] from; to [[defame]] or [[decry]]. 

